Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_NET_PROFIT,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_SAME_DAY_LY 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_YEAR >= 1965 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_BILL_HDEMO_SK = 3934


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.WS_NET_PROFIT AS "WS_NET_PROFIT",
  Q2.D_SAME_DAY_LY AS "D_SAME_DAY_LY" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q1.WS_BILL_HDEMO_SK = 3934) AND 
  (1965 <= Q2.D_YEAR)

Explain level:    Explain from section

